{
 "title": "Mandate",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Mandate",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c243",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "World War I breaks the Ottoman Empire.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c244",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And Britain takes Palestine.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c245",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "During the war, London makes promises that can't all be kept.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c246",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "To Arab leaders, promises of independence.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c247",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in November 1917, in the Balfour Declaration,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c248",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a letter of a few lines.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c249",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Britain views with favor,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c250",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a national home for the Jewish people in Palestine.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c251",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Provided nothing harms the rights",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c252",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of the existing non-Jewish communities.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c253",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jews cheer.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c254",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Arabs, then about nine in 10 of the people there,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c255",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "see a foreign power promising away their country.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c256",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the 1920s and 30s, Jewish immigration rises",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c257",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from Poland and after Hitler from Germany.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c258",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Tel Aviv grows from a sand-dune suburb into a city.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c259",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Kibbutzim spread.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c260",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Land is bought often from absent landlords",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c261",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and sometimes the Arab farmers who worked it are evicted.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c262",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Take 1929.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c263",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A dispute over access to the Western Wall",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c264",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "explodes into riots across Palestine.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c265",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In Hebron, Arab mobs kill 67 Jews.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c266",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the survivors are driven out of a Jewish community",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c267",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that had lived there for centuries.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c268",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "More than 100 Arabs are killed too,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c269",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "most of them by British police and troops.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c270",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Trust between the communities shrinks.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c271",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By 1936, with the Jewish share of the population",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c272",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "more than a quarter and rising,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c273",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinian Arabs launch a revolt against both Britain",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c274",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Jewish settlement.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c275",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Britain crushes it, killing thousands.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c276",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Jewish militias, the Haganah,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c277",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and the more militant Irgun fight back",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c278",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and sometimes attack Arab civilians.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c279",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Violence from both sides is already part of the story.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c280",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the middle of the revolt in 1937,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c281",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a British commission, the Peel Commission,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c282",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "concludes that the two peoples cannot share one government",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c283",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and proposes the first partition plan,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c284",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a small Jewish state and a larger Arab one.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c285",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Most Zionist leaders accept the principle with doubts.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c286",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Arab leaders reject it, nothing happens.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c287",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then in May 1939, as war looms and Jews",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c288",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "need an escape more than ever,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c289",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Britain issues a white paper.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c290",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It caps Jewish immigration at 75,000 over five years,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c291",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "then ends it unless Arabs agree.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c292",
     "shot": "g_mandate",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The door closes at the worst possible moment.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}